# Host Patterns

Host patterns specify which managed nodes Ansible should target.

## Examples

Target all servers

```bash
ansible all -m ping
```

Target one host

```bash
ansible web1 -m ping
```

Target web servers

```bash
ansible webservers -m ping
```

Target databases

```bash
ansible databases -m ping
```

Limit execution

```bash
ansible-playbook site.yml --limit webservers
```

Exclude hosts

```bash
ansible all:!databases -m ping
```
